## 🛠️ Deployment Configuration Specification

The complete resource layout is declared below in `pod-volume-share.yaml`:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: volume-share-datacenter
spec:
  volumes:
    - name: volume-share
      emptyDir: {}
  containers:
    - name: volume-container-datacenter-1
      image: fedora:latest
      command: ["/bin/sh", "-c", "sleep 3600"]
      volumeMounts:
        - name: volume-share
          mountPath: /tmp/official
    - name: volume-container-datacenter-2
      image: fedora:latest
      command: ["/bin/sh", "-c", "sleep 3600"]
      volumeMounts:
        - name: volume-share
          mountPath: /tmp/games
```

